From: NBOSP <nbosp@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] seat: don't dereference a NULL focused view on button press

press_cursor_button() calls view_is_transient_for(current, view) with the
keyboard-focused view. seat_get_focus() returns NULL when no surface has
keyboard focus, and view_is_transient_for() reads current->impl, so a button
press over a view with nothing focused segfaults Cage and takes the whole
session down. With nothing focused there is no dialog to be transient for,
so just focus the clicked view.
---
diff --git a/seat.c b/seat.c
--- a/seat.c
+++ b/seat.c
@@ -104,7 +104,7 @@
 
 		/* Focus that client if the button was pressed and
 		   it has no open dialogs. */
-		if (view && !view_is_transient_for(current, view)) {
+		if (view && (!current || !view_is_transient_for(current, view))) {
 			seat_set_focus(seat, view);
 		}
 	}
